  "description": "U.S. Marines with Marine Aviation Weapons and Tactics Squadron One (MAWTS-1) conduct hoist operations during the final exercise of Weapons and Tactics Instructor (WTI) course 2-23 off the coast of San Clemente Island, California, April 21, 2023. WTI, hosted by MAWTS-1, is a seven-week course providing standardized advanced tactical training and certification of unit instructor qualifications to support Marine aviation training and readiness. (U.S. Marine Corps video by Cpl. Eric Ramirez)",
